{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You Can't See!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of a blind traveler, where every tap of your guide cane reveals the unseen. You navigate environments that are familiar or distant\u2014 home, subway, a bustling street\u2014illuminating objects through touch and memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623320/extras/radar.gif?t=1745287220\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three levels (hospital, home and park)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two dream sequences </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three difficulty settings for additional challenge </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyboard and controller support </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Spectator&quot; mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six levels\u00a0(+ subway, street and school)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Five dream sequences and secret ending </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playable in five languages (English, Chinese, Japanese, Spanish and Russian) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievement system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623320/extras/playground.gif?t=1745287220\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623320?t=1745287220","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623320?t=1745287220","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623320/75720e6f67eab8f36b2db929eb6f56f4b54e803f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745287220"